<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Stay With Me</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">You Me At Six</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Hold Me Down</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5jZAtF5byijpW7UCJsUYK8</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.110" end="00:34.000">You've got a to lot say for the one that walked away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.000" end="00:40.750">I give, you take that's the way it's always been</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.750" end="00:47.510">Oh, how do I know if I should stay or just go?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.510" end="00:55.510">The bottom line is this way that I'll never know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.620" end="01:05.250">Stay with me with me, stay with</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.250" end="01:13.250">Stay with me, oh a-woah,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.000" end="01:24.440" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.440" end="01:32.090">You've got a lot to say for the one that pushed me away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.090" end="01:38.870">I give, you take some things, they never change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.870" end="01:43.170">Just change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.170" end="01:49.860">Stay with me with me, stay with</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.860" end="01:56.760">Stay with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.760" end="02:03.470">I never knew that I could be this way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.470" end="02:11.470">I never knew that I could walk away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.750" end="02:17.520">These things take time to grow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.520" end="02:24.590">It's been said that time heals wounds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.590" end="02:31.640">But no, I won't be controlled</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.640" end="02:39.640">And so the story goes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.520" end="02:53.120">Stay with me with me, stay with</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.120" end="02:59.130">Stay with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.130" end="03:05.830">And now I know that I can be this way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.830" end="03:09.830">And now I know that I can walk away</p></div></body></tt>